    "sourceLine": 7994,
    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Tip of the Spear\nAs a Vanguard, you lead and direct your allies, pushing them ever onwards, supporting them when they might otherwise fail. Each Vanguard Branch, and some Skills and Talents, will provide you with the opportunity to use this Feature to grant beneficial effects to an ally; each instance will specify the conditions under which you do so.\n:\nWhen you use this Feature, choose an allied Creature you can see within 60 feet; roll 1d6 and apply the corresponding effect to them until the start of your next Turn; these effects are cumulative.\n\n\n| Roll | Effect                      |\n|:----:|:---------------------------:|\n| 1    | Additional Damage equal to your Proficiency Bonus on one Damage Roll of their choice.\n| 2    | They gain 1d6 Temporary Hit Points; these Hit Points are additive with any Temporary Hit Points they already have.\n| 3    | Speed increased by 10 feet.\n| 4    | +2 Bonus to Attack Rolls.\n| 5    | Critical Range increased by 1.\n| 6    | Whenever they gain a Skill Point, they gain 1 more.",
